  "description": "Marquis Alpheus Rhodian is brilliant, handsome, and infamously distant. Edith, his no-nonsense treasurer, is roped into pretending to be his fiancée to ward off an unwanted match. But as their fake engagement unfolds, Alpheus’s sincerity leaves Edith questioning what’s real. A cold marquis and a lady guarded in iron - can their contract turn into something more?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
